1
00:00:00,317 --> 00:00:04,924
The home page — Every GALIL app in your pocket.

2
00:00:05,881 --> 00:00:11,734
On a phone, the home page is the same: a greeting, and a tile for each of your apps.

3
00:00:13,283 --> 00:00:17,885
Taskana, the Handbook and the Knowledge Base follow — each with its own numbers.

4
00:00:19,393 --> 00:00:23,745
The shortcuts go straight to reporting time, days off, expenses and your tasks.

5
00:00:24,364 --> 00:00:29,716
Install on your phone adds the portal to your home screen, so it opens like an app.

6
00:00:31,221 --> 00:00:35,837
At the top: the save status, the language, light or dark, and your profile.

7
00:00:36,436 --> 00:00:38,440
Tap WorkDesk to open it.

8
00:00:41,338 --> 00:00:45,841
WorkDesk's phone layout: four tabs at the bottom. The house at the top brings you back home.

9
00:00:46,543 --> 00:00:50,655
Every app, one tap away — More help: the Handbook → The Employee Portal.
